    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37798" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praenum</span></b> , i, n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>an implement for
				combing flax</i>, <i>a hatchel</i>, Gloss.
			Philox. —Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>an instrument of
				torture</i>, <i>a rack</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tentare praenum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
